ro.","Capex runs only 0.2x depreciation (0.1% of sales), so the asset base is being harvested rather than grown.","Its Rule of 40 score is -15, below the 40 that marks a healthy growth business."],"own":["Insiders own 12.6%, meaningful skin in the game, and institutions hold 97%.","Insiders have only sold over the past year (9 sales, net $887K sold).","It returns 2.1% a year to shareholders (2.1% in buybacks).","The share count has shrunk 0.5% a year over five years, steadily raising each holder's stake.","Short interest is elevated at 20.9% of the float, 8.0 days to cover."],"people":["With about 1,056 employees, each generates about $1.6M of revenue, 4.2x the Consumer Cyclical median, and revenue has grown 21.6% a year across its filed history.","Free cash flow is negative, at -$133K per employee.","CEO pay is $1.0M (1x revenue per employee), and compensation governance scores well (3/10, lower is better).","Stock compensation averages $6K per employee."]},"profile":{"v":"AVOID","conv":18,"head":"Avoid: priced 34% above its fair value of $30.76.","pros":["P/E 13.5x vs sector 18.8x","1 analysts' mean target $93.00 (+125%)"],"cons":["Trades 34% above fair value of $30.76","ROIC 6.1% vs WACC 7.5%","FCF margin 8.3% (burns cash)","Revenue shrank 6.4%/yr over 5y","Net debt/EBITDA 19.7x"],"flags":["Priced 34% above its fair value of $30.76","Altman Z in the distress zone (1.59)","Earns below its cost of capital and burns cash"],"need":[],"buy_below":26.15,"vc":{"base":30.76,"base_src":"blend","bear":null,"bull":null,"alt_median":30.76,"n_alt":2,"gap":null,"dispersion":0.1607,"level":"MEDIUM","why":[]},"med":{"pe":18.8184,"ev_ebitda":10.707,"pfcf":16.6971,"pb":2.3,"roic":0.1268,"gross_margin":0.346,"fcf_margin":0.0621,"div_yield":0.0232}},"ticker":"LGIH","date":"2026-11-13"}